      "kind": "template",
      "statement": "Two parallel lines are cut by a transversal. One interior angle measures ${{a}}^\\circ$. Find the measure of the co-interior (same-side interior) angle.",
      "answer": "${{180 - a}}^\\circ$",
      "solution": "Co-interior angles on the same side of a transversal are supplementary when the lines are parallel, so they add to $180^\\circ$.",
