      "topic": "Angles",
      "subtopic": "Angles in a polygon",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "kind": "template",
      "statement": "Find the sum of the interior angles of a convex polygon with ${{n}}$ sides.",
      "answer": "${{(n - 2)*180}}^\\circ$",
      "solution": "A polygon with $n$ sides splits into $n - 2$ triangles, each contributing $180^\\circ$: $({{n}} - 2)(180) = {{(n - 2)*180}}$ degrees.",
